  "description": "Wraps IDispatcher with a query cache and tRPC-style subscriptions for Rask components: dedup, staleness, background refetch and invalidation, scoped to the live session so one visitor is never served another's data, plus QueryClient.Subscribe — every published CQRS event re-renders the pages watching it. The C# counterpart of what a React front end gets from TanStack Query, on every .NET host.",
